# Node version

Before running any `npm`, `npx`, `pnpm`, `yarn`, or `node` command, activate Node 24.22.2 with nvm in the same shell command:

```bash
source ~/.nvm/nvm.sh && nvm use 24.22.2 && npm install
```

- Chain with `&&` so the version switch applies to the command (each shell call may start fresh).
- If 24.22.2 is not installed, run `nvm install 24.22.2` first.
- Never run npm commands under a different Node version.
